<p>The uncrating phase follows strict protocols to safeguard electrical and mechanical items, ensure clean placement of furniture, and remove packing debris swiftly. Technicians test each appliance on‑site, position furniture according to the floor plan, and clear the work area to maintain a safe environment for occupants.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
